## Feature 3: School Marketplace & Detail Pages

**Description:** A trustworthy school page, every fact with its source.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US3.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want a school page with its photo, levels, board, admission status, Google rating, facilities and achievements, each saying where it came from, so I can judge the school.
- **US3.2 (Parent) — Planned:** As a parent, I want a full breakdown of the fees that make up the TCO.
- **US3.3 (Parent) — Planned:** As a parent, I want to compare up to 4 schools side by side.
- **US3.6 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want schools, after-school classes and colleges kept apart, so the main list holds only schools from preschool to class 12.
- **US3.7 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want a friendly, colourful app with a picture on every school (its photo, or a drawing when there is none).

### Backend User Stories
- **US3.4 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to deliver full school profile data: facilities, achievements, photo with credit, and facts with their sources.
- **US3.5 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to import Google Places data (ratings, types, location) for the market's schools.
- **US3.8 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need to sort every place into school / after-school class / college, and hide places not for children, from the name first and Google's type second, with admin overrides.

