## Feature 4: Admissions & Enquiry Gateway

**Description:** Connecting parents to schools.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US4.1 (Parent) — Partly built:** As a parent, I want to ask a school about admissions (class, roughly when, my question) and continue the conversation in the app. *Built as enquiries; the full Kidscover Standard application form is planned.*
- **US4.2 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent viewing a school, I want a link to its own website.
- **US4.3 (School Admin) — Partly built:** As a school admissions user, I want a dashboard of incoming enquiries and applications. *The enquiry inbox is built for Kidscover staff; access for partner schools' own staff is planned.*

### Backend User Stories
- **US4.4 (Backend) — Planned:** As a system, I need to push the Kidscover Standard form to a partner school's CRM by webhook.
- **US4.5 (Backend) — Planned:** As a system, I need to log outbound clicks to non-partner schools.
- **US4.6 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need enquiry limits (one open enquiry per school, 10 new a day, confirmed email) and no child data in an enquiry.

