## Feature 5: Ticketing & Notifications

**Description:** Secure, two-way communication.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US5.1 (Parent) — Built:** As a parent, I want to message a school without sharing my phone number, and see how many replies I have not read.
- **US5.2 (School Admin) — Partly built:** As an admissions user, I want to reply to parents in the portal. *Built for Kidscover staff.*
- **US5.3 (Parent) — Planned:** As a parent, I want push notifications when a school replies.

### Backend User Stories
- **US5.4 (Backend) — Built:** As a system, I need a messaging schema tying each conversation to the parent and the school, with read marks for both sides.
- **US5.5 (Backend) — Planned:** As a system, I need push notifications (Firebase Cloud Messaging / APNs) triggered by replies and status changes.

